
### 1. 회원가입 요청
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser02",
  "email": "testuser02@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "name": "홍길동2",
  "userRole": "USER"
}


###

### 2. 로그인 (JWT 토큰 받기)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser01@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###

### 🔐 3. JWT 토큰이 있는 경우 헤더 포함 (토큰 발급 후 사용할 것)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?creatorEmail=testuser01@example.com
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlcjAxQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlJPTEVfVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc1MDIwOTQyMCwiZXhwIjoxNzUwMjEzMDIwfQ.wTJ0J0XM80xsDKwgTctOveiJtEFwyYsBZgcHEoh0esw

{
  "title": "1번 일정",
  "description": "Todo 디폴트 확인",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "managerName": "testuser01@example.com",
  "dueDate": "2025-06-23T23:59:00"
}

### 4. 일정 조회 (칸반 보드 형식, 상태별 그룹)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?requesterEmail=testuser01@example.com
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlcjAxQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlJPTEVfVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc1MDIwOTQyMCwiZXhwIjoxNzUwMjEzMDIwfQ.wTJ0J0XM80xsDKwgTctOveiJtEFwyYsBZgcHEoh0esw

###

### 4-1. 단건 일정 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1?requesterEmail=testuser01@example.com
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlcjAxQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlJPTEVfVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc1MDIwOTQyMCwiZXhwIjoxNzUwMjEzMDIwfQ.wTJ0J0XM80xsDKwgTctOveiJtEFwyYsBZgcHEoh0esw

###

### 5. 일정 수정 요청 (taskId에 실제 ID 입력)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1?requesterEmail=testuser01@example.com
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlcjAxQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlJPTEVfVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc1MDE2NTYyMCwiZXhwIjoxNzUwMTY5MjIwfQ.md8ULD_UXlFqrBh-O6fpUdGmqN3bb1j8QX4PUw69C5s

{
  "title": "담당자 변경",
  "description": "수정된 설명입니다.",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "managerName": "testuser02@example.com",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "dueDate": "2025-06-24T23:59:00"
}

###

### 6. 일정 삭제 요청 (taskId에 실제 ID 입력)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1?requesterEmail=testuser01@example.com
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlcjAxQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlJPTEVfVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc1MDE2NTYyMCwiZXhwIjoxNzUwMTY5MjIwfQ.md8ULD_UXlFqrBh-O6fpUdGmqN3bb1j8QX4PUw69C5s